{
  "slug": "kudosity-sms",
  "name": "Kudosity Sms",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Send SMS and MMS messages, manage contacts, and configure messaging workflows using the Kudosity platform.\n\nThis plugin enables Claude to create and send messages, manage contact lists, trigger campaigns, and handle delivery workflows via the Kudosity messaging API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 command** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `create-list` (Create contact lists and add contacts to them on the Kudosity platform), `send-mms` (Send MMS (multimedia) messages via the Kudosity platform), `send-sms` (Send SMS messages via the Kudosity platform), `setup-webhook` (Create and manage webhooks on the Kudosity platform)\n- **Agents** (1): `kudosity-assistant` (A specialized assistant for Kudosity messaging operations)\n- **Commands** (1): `setup` (Configure your Kudosity API credentials and verify they work correctly)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `kudosity`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install kudosity-sms@claude-community` from `kudosity/kudosity-claude-sms-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
